        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Amagansett Dummy Handleset from the Classico Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Classico Collection Amagansett Dummy Handleset is most often used on the inactive side of a pair of double doors. Using a Pair Dummy Handleset ensures that the hardware on both doors matches. The Amagansett Dummy Handleset n is available in several stunningly beautiful finishes that are unique to Omnia's Classico Collection. It can be ordered with your favorite ornate interior trim lever or knob. A Dummy Mortise Handleset like the Amagansett does not latch or lock but it still looks beautiful.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso See <a href=\"/products/omnia-classico-collection-amagansett-mortise-handleset\"><b>Omnia Classico Collection Amagansett Keyed Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classico Collection Amagansett Pair Dummy Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non-rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Amagansett Classico Collection Dummy Handleset for Double Doors:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 21\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: Interior knob/lever, backplates, and all necessary screws and templates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia AMAGANSETT Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
